# compiled module artifacts. The default build directory is `ecobuild` beside each manifest, so a library's
# artifacts live with the code they belong to - deleting a checkout deletes them, and no two projects share
# one. `echoc clean` is the tidy way to remove them
ecobuild/

# what older versions of echoc used for the same thing. Kept so a checkout made before the rename does not
# start showing one; nothing writes here any more, and `echoc clean` says so when it finds one
.echo/
